[[Open This|Install Oxide CLI in Termux]]

---

Update packages:Bash

```bash
pkg update && pkg upgrade
```

Install Rust (and dependencies):Bash

```bash
pkg install rust clang libllvm
```

Install the CLI via Cargo (this pulls the latest):Bash

```bash
cargo install oxide-cli
```

Add to PATH if needed: 

```bash
echo 'export PATH="$HOME/.cargo/bin:$PATH"' >> ~/.bashrc &&
```

